  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Asian Elephant Conservation Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This projects objectives are as follows: (1) initiate, supervise and support community based human-elephant conflict (HEC) mitigation (CBCM) in order to decrease losses and damages caused by elephants and thus the risk of elephants getting killed or injured by frustrated and/or ruined farmers, (2) train local people in effective HEC mitigation strategies and methods in order to provide the basis for CBCM and eventually coexistence of elephants and people, and, (3) intensify education activities in order to increase the level of tolerance towards elephants in local communities and to raise awareness concerning the importance of conservation and sustainability concepts.</narrative>
  </description>
